OL,4,Afrom market values
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever the latest US employment
OL,7,Ffigures added to a mixed picture for
OL,8,FAmerican markets on Friday morning,
OL,9,Fwith an unexpectedly strong 165,000
OL,10,Fjobs added to the economy in September.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
